things for too long.

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:44.190
That goes for the sauna, 
and for a woman's temptation.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:46.720
I'm good at self-control.

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:50.570
What about you? You should 
probably give up and leave soon.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:59.200
Your samurai soul is impressive...

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:05.700
Have some water.

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:09.490
<i>I should call Akane-san.</i>

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:10.710
Wait a second.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.720
Feed me with your mouth.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.010
No, no.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.840
I'll go get the nurse!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:21.600
If you don't... I'll scream.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:29.110
Reito-sama, I brought help!

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:36.110
Reito-sama is mating with a 
strange woman before any of us!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.490
No, this is...

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.620
Reito-sama, you traitor!

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.570
Sorry for bothering you.

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:41.570
You're such an animal.

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:43.370
You've got it wrong.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.320
That was fun.

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:47.370
It was an act?

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:50.250
American girls are strong.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:53.150
It'd take more than that to knock me out.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:58.780
Now let's have a nice long 
chat, Mizuhara Reito-san.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.440
Harder!

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:04.430
Sorry.

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:05.860
Please.

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:06.940
Thank you.

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:10.690
There's a bakery on the corner 
just outside this building, kid.

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:12.940
I want a white bean jam pastry from there.

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:15.400
I can send someone from UW...

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.690
I'm not eating it unless he gets it for me.

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:20.590
All right. I'll go.

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:21.450
Mizuhara-san!

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:25.710
You.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.920
I want to talk with you privately.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.210
Come in.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.840
You know about Tachibana Erisa, right?

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:38.470
She's Mizuhara-sama's childhood friend.

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:40.840
That's not what I meant.

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.140
I'll ask a different question, then.

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:53.330
Tell me what that kid's like.

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.680
Why do you want to know?

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:57.110
Just answer me.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:59.860
Don't you want to help him?

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.870
Mizuhara-sama is very selfish.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:08.430
It's wonderful that he's working on a cure.

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:13.340
But I think he could mate at least once or 
twice a week even while doing his research.

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.660
With the world on the brink of destruction,

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:20.230
having someone he's in love with is not 
a good enough reason to refuse mating.

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:24.140
He really is selfish.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:28.140
But not many people could do that.

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:31.990
He has the same desires as any normal man.

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:33.650
But he's always fighting them.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:38.340
And he can keep being selfish 
in the face of the entire world.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:41.910
He may really be able to save the world.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:45.410
You know him well.

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:48.680
Well, I'm always watching him.

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:51.920
I got it.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:52.970
You're late.

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:54.170
I don't want it now.

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:58.550
Are you never going to have kids, then?

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:03.560
If it really will help humanity, 
I might, some day.

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:07.680
You'll give up on the girl you love.

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:12.950
No. Even if I did mate, I'd only 
do it because they wanted me to.

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:14.690
My heart wouldn't change.

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:18.190
I only love one girl.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.550
I'm tired today.

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:24.420
Come back tomorrow.

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:27.610
I'll make you listen to 
me talk about old times.

00:20:27.610 --> 00:20:28.450
Okay.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:31.580
I would like to talk about 
my husband once in a while.

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:34.460
I'll come! I promise!

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:43.970
No one would fault you for giving up on saving 
the world and being with the man you love.

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.870
You're so stubborn!

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:50.850
If you don't hurry, you'll lose him!

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.130
He had a whole bunch of pretty 
ladies with him today—

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:56.360
<i>Even if Reito falls in 
love with someone else,</i>

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:59.080
<i>I'll only ever love him.</i>

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:05.610
You're both very similar.

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:07.620
<b>Keimon City Central Hospital</b>

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.330
Her condition suddenly worsened!

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:24.510
She was doing just fine until today.

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:27.390
S-She'll be fine, right?

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:30.700
She's in a coma. It could go either way.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:34.000
Um, this is from her.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.140
What is it?

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:38.060
Taniguchi-san, what's wrong?

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:43.780
If something happens, give this to the kid.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:47.780
Taniguchi-san.

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:49.980
I'll take it.

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:53.290
I'll come give it back when she's better.

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:55.790
Take care of her until then.

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:57.000
Okay...

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Episode 6</b>

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Intertwining Plots</b>
